<title>BELGIUM: SGB says to renew stock buy option.</title>
<headline>SGB says to renew stock buy option.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian holding company SGB said on Wednesday it would ask its shareholders to allow it to buy up to three percent of its own shares for a 12-month period.</p>
<p>The measure is part of an SGB effort to regulate the market in its own shares.  </p>
<p>The company used the facility -- also applied by many other Belgian companies -- last year to buy some of its own shares.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
